# Cursor models — no Grok

Do **not** use Grok models (e.g. `cursor-grok-*`, “Grok” in the model picker) for this project.

Prefer the user’s selected default or another non-Grok model (e.g. Composer, Claude, GPT). Do not launch subagents with Grok; use an allowed alternative instead.
